      "message": "This is a bit scary as the alignment requirement isn\u0027t the same as `hyp_spinlock_t`. Why do we need the `unused` array at all?\n\nFor the CPU-side structures, we have separate definitions for the hypervisor and the host (e.g. `pkvm_hyp_vcpu` vs `kvm_vcpu`).",
